            },
            {
                "entry_id": "2df443df-72c8-311d-a46f-1c2960fdf4de",
                "word": "liana",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c01aba08-cfa7-4402-b299-34870adea080",
                        "entry_id": "2df443df-72c8-311d-a46f-1c2960fdf4de",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "lianas"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "aa72630c-13de-329d-91ed-1316298d8c3b",
                        "entry_id": "2df443df-72c8-311d-a46f-1c2960fdf4de",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A climbing woody vine, usually tropical."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f186da55-86b1-4fa2-b55a-c919f0b25ce9",
                                "sense_id": "aa72630c-13de-329d-91ed-1316298d8c3b",
                                "text": "Many of the older trees presented a very curious appearance from the tresses of a liana hanging from their boughs, and resembling bundles of hay."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfca4f9a-a3e5-41fc-97d4-b15b279ba0a6",
                                "sense_id": "aa72630c-13de-329d-91ed-1316298d8c3b",
                                "text": "1884, Achilles Daunt, Frank Redcliffe: A story of travel and adventure in the forests of Venezuela (A Book for Boys), London: T. Nelson & Sons, Chapter 5, p. 99,\nFlowering lianas hung in long streaming lines from the outstretched boughs and dipped their pendulous bouquets in the water of the igarape, which reflected the cloudless blue of the sky."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df4920bb-b88b-4bc1-892b-79db8ed904db",
                                "sense_id": "aa72630c-13de-329d-91ed-1316298d8c3b",
                                "text": "Allow friendly natives to walk in front of you on the track. They have sharp eyes for pitfalls, snakes, hornets, and stinging plants. They will cut the lianas and thorny trailers. They like to do it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "66e9f99e-257d-4c69-a555-ce990f1018d5",
                                "sense_id": "aa72630c-13de-329d-91ed-1316298d8c3b",
                                "text": "They left the drive and stood among the wild tannia under the saman tree. Mrs Tulsi held a liana and offered it to Mr Biswas. While he felt it, she held a thinner liana and pulled it down. ‘As strong as rope,’ she said. ‘The children could skip with this.’"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6f4fcd8f-0b66-4fb9-aa9f-b8b80ec8a49d",
                        "source_entry_id": "2df443df-72c8-311d-a46f-1c2960fdf4de",
                        "source_sense_id": "aa72630c-13de-329d-91ed-1316298d8c3b",
                        "source_sense_description": "climbing woody vine",
                        "target_lang_word": "liaan",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "liaan",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f895a39c-e64c-34a0-82fc-8a91a28a35e2",
                                        "entry_id": "506e975d-706c-340b-8a56-99d71c362cad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een plant die in lange slingers in de bomen van een oerwoud hangt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3cd5e31-06ad-4bf8-9bea-c64e0d13e4cb",
                                                "sense_id": "f895a39c-e64c-34a0-82fc-8a91a28a35e2",
                                                "text": "Tarzan slingerde met lianen van boom tot boom."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35e7a27d-357d-441d-9074-28de4eb30151",
                                                "sense_id": "f895a39c-e64c-34a0-82fc-8a91a28a35e2",
                                                "text": "Dus nu zou het zwemmen worden, daar liep het altijd op uit. Eerst zou Tarzan een beetje aan lianen slingeren tot hij bij een rivier of meer kwam, waar hij in dook en wegzwom van de krokodillen alsof het een makkie was."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fe09b05b-4e5c-41a6-b2f2-d6714c2e2508",
                        "source_entry_id": "2df443df-72c8-311d-a46f-1c2960fdf4de",
                        "source_sense_id": "aa72630c-13de-329d-91ed-1316298d8c3b",
                        "source_sense_description": "climbing woody vine",
                        "target_lang_word": "Liane",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Liane",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "255e31e3-33fc-3c74-a1f4-80da475b1aa6",
                                        "entry_id": "e4fde1c2-53ae-3ec5-8c97-bdcd54fa98d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "verholzende Pflanze, die an anderen Pflanzen oder senkrechten Strukturen emporwächst, da sie sich nicht selbst tragen kann"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61fd910a-524e-4f4a-a9f1-2ffede54a730",
                                                "sense_id": "255e31e3-33fc-3c74-a1f4-80da475b1aa6",
                                                "text": "Lianen sind untereinander nicht näher verwandt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e84233f-98fd-4abf-8e9e-d8cf365ed29b",
                                                "sense_id": "255e31e3-33fc-3c74-a1f4-80da475b1aa6",
                                                "text": "„Er zeigte mir eine Stelle, wo Lianen hingen, an denen man schwingen konnte wie Tarzan.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87643b08-7726-4cc2-9274-97fbd6fc3fc3",
                                                "sense_id": "255e31e3-33fc-3c74-a1f4-80da475b1aa6",
                                                "text": "„Selbst dort, wo viele der Lianen zu finden sind, muss ein Sammler 14 Tage arbeiten, um drei bis vier Kilo getrockneten Kautschuks zusammenzutragen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4cae0458-d990-4404-ab7c-7c86bd419350",
                                                "sense_id": "255e31e3-33fc-3c74-a1f4-80da475b1aa6",
                                                "text": "„Kaba blieb jetzt nicht mehr stehen, um uns den Namen dieser oder jener Liane zu nennen, um uns ihre Verwendungszwecke zu erläutern – Wundermedizin, Vogelleim, Pfeilgift.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8f097e1-d677-4648-b968-5ed312c16957",
                                                "sense_id": "255e31e3-33fc-3c74-a1f4-80da475b1aa6",
                                                "text": "„In ruhigem Wasser hinter einem Ufervorsprung banden sie ein paar stärkere Äste mit Lianen zu einem Floß, auf das sie die Holzbündel stapelten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "083ebc6c-dd2f-43fe-86d6-7bd580a8908f",
